# Attribution for the vendored ChartJOG bundle

`ChartJOG.Controls.js` in this directory is an unmodified, pre-built bundle. It
contains JOG's ChartJOG control together with two bundled MIT-licensed
libraries. All three are reproduced under the MIT license.

## ChartJOG

- Project: JOG (JavaScript Object GUI), package `ChartJOG`
- Source: https://github.com/jjanuszczak/jog
- Source file: `v2/packages-src/ChartJOG.Controls.source.js`
- Source commit: 118d2be72f2368cff40bacdc1ca39b3f1dd6670a
- Bundle version: 1.0.0 (reported by the bundled control metadata)
- License: MIT (see `LICENSE` in this directory)

## Bundled third-party libraries

The bundle inlines these libraries. Their license texts are reproduced beside
this file so they travel with the release archives.

